	(text "100 nF each on VDD and VDDIO, close to U1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "292de470-9985-48f2-ae8f-b7da81a56679")
	)
	(text "CONSOLE CONNECTOR\n3V3 from the RP2350-Plus. SDA/SCL = GP0/GP1 (I2C0). INT = GP2.\nVBAT = the console's VSYS: always on while its LiPo is fitted, about 3.4-4.95 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29d6a8b5-e557-490a-a2de-fd7c1b567b1c")
	)
	(text "I2C pull-ups (console has none).\nINT is open-drain, shared by\nIMU INT1 and RTC ~INT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "537fb833-27ab-479c-97b1-2cce03e32cf5")
	)
	(text "HAPTICS\nDRV2605L, I2C address 0x5A. ERM mode, effects triggered over I2C.\nRun auto-calibration once for the motor.\nREG: 1 uF to GND. VDD: 1 uF + 100 nF. Motor: Vybronics VZ43FC1B SMD ERM, about 77 mA at 3 V.\nIts leads are swapped (OUT+ to motor -) to keep the PCB traces apart:\nan ERM vibrates the same in either direction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "747fc612-2249-471c-ab7b-690b0a032c08")
	)
	(text "GYROSCOPE + ACCELEROMETER\nLSM6DS3TR-C, I2C address 0x6A (SA0 = GND).\nINT1 set to open-drain (CTRL3_C PP_OD = 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5dc7348-84c6-4f79-8b95-c9a1ecc3130c")
	)
	(text "REAL-TIME CLOCK\nRV-3028-C7, I2C address 0x52. Crystal built in.\nFirmware: enable backup switchover (BSM = 11, LSM) and store it in EEPROM;\nkeep the trickle charger off (TCE = 0, default): VBACKUP is the console's VSYS.\nCLKOUT is on by default: turn it off to save current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.69 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c21c9c77-2394-474a-8d92-01164ed42faa")
	)
	(text "EVI unused: must not float, 10 k to GND.\n100 nF on VDD and on VBACKUP, close to U2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e98995a1-13bd-4f6a-8a3e-e44937c87676")
	)
